    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (4) does not apply if registration of the charge has been effected on the application of some other person"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): subsection (6) says only when subsection (4) does not apply

-- src:12023 | (4) If a company fails to comply with subsection (1), an offence is committed by—
