-- src:12048 | (5) References in this Chapter to the date of the creation of a charge are—
-- src:12049 | (a) in the case of a floating charge, the date on which the instrument creating the floating charge was executed by the company creating the charge, and
-- src:12050 | (b) in any other case, the date on which the right of the person entitled to the benefit of the charge was constituted as a real right.
@ref s 879(5) References in this Chapter to the date of the creation of a charge are (src:12048-12050)
GIVEN `the charge is a floating charge` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the instrument creating the floating charge was executed by the company creating the charge` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the right of the person entitled to the benefit of the charge was constituted as a real right` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 879(5) the date of the creation of the charge` MEANS
