        IF item EQUALS `s 891(2) the names of the persons entitled to it` AND `the charge is a security to bearer`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "except in the case of securities to bearer"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:12148 | (3) If an officer of the company knowingly and wilfully authorises or permits the omission of an entry required to be made in pursuance of this section, he commits an offence.
@ref s 891(3) If an officer of the company knowingly and wilfully authorises or permits the omission of an entry required to be made in pursuance of this section, he commits an offence (src:12148-12148)
