    IF `the documents are required to be kept available for inspection under section 890, or are a company's register of charges kept in pursuance of section 891`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "This section applies to—": a scope list with no "only" (as in s 878(7), fork F-C2)

-- src:12156 | (2) The documents and register must be kept available for inspection—
-- src:12157 | (a) at the company's registered office, or
-- src:12158 | (b) at a place specified in regulations under section 1136.
@ref s 892(2) The documents and register must be kept available for inspection at the company's registered office or at a place specified in regulations under section 1136 (src:12156-12158)
