    IF `the documents and register are kept at the company's registered office`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE CONSIDER `s 1136 Regulations about where certain company records to be kept available for inspection`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The documents and register must be kept available for inspection—": a bare "must", not met (fork F-P1 in NOTES.md)
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the places specified in regulations under s 1136 are another section's answer

