-- src:12160 | (a) of the place at which the documents and register are kept available for inspection, and
-- src:12161 | (b) of any change in that place,
-- src:12162 | unless they have at all times been kept at the company's registered office.
@ref s 892(3) The company must give notice to the registrar of the place and of any change in that place, unless they have at all times been kept at the company's registered office (src:12159-12162)
GIVEN `the documents and register have at all times been kept at the company's registered office` IS A BOOLEAN
