DECLARE `s 892(4) terms of inspection` IS ONE OF
    `s 892(4)(a) open to inspection without charge`
    `s 892(4)(b) open to inspection on payment of the prescribed fee` HAS `the fee in pounds that is prescribed` IS A NUMBER

