    IF `an inspection required under subsection (4) is refused`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If an inspection required under subsection (4) is refused the court may by order compel an immediate inspection": the court's power is given for a refused inspection and the text does not say it has none otherwise
